{
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Kick.Blocked": " You manage to get your shield in the way of her legs in time."
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Kick.Dodged": " You just barely weave out of the way of the brutal maneuver."
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Kick.Lead": "The green frog-girl jumps up and kicks you in your chest with her powerful legs!"
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Kick.Parry": " You catch her legs on your weapon and shove them aside."
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Kick.Stunned": " Her attack ends up forcing all the air from your lungs, leaving you momentarily stunned."
  "Combat.FrogGirl.Tease.Lead": "The green frog-girl slightly spreads her thighs for you, exposing her hole that glistens even in the bog's dim light. Perhaps she is trying to taunt you with the wonderful pleasure you're missing out on."
